			"mark": "TALK_MARK_COMMON",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Drusus"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 735030101,
					"content": "Oh, this is a good one...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Drusus"
				},
				{
					"id": 735030102,
					"content": "Are you working on your riddles again?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 735030103,
					"content": "Traveler! You've come at the right time! I'm about to design a whole new series of riddles.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Drusus"
				},
				{
					"id": 735030104,
					"content": "The terrain here is a little complicated. See, there is a huge root of the Divine Tree entering the water from one side of the harbor.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Drusus"
				},
				{
					"id": 735030105,
					"content": "On the other side is a huge lotus leaf, and a lot of ships waiting to leave the harbor.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Drusus"
				},
				{
					"id": 735030106,
					"content": "Traveler, which side do you feel is better as the theme for this riddle?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030107,
						735030110,
						735030113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Drusus"
				},
				{
					"id": 735030107,
					"content": "It's better to start with the root system.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030108
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 735030108,
					"content": "Really? The huge root system of the Divine Tree is quite conspicuous, and easily seen as the \"entry point\" of the riddle.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Drusus"
				},
				{
					"id": 735030109,
					"content": "Okay! I'll write a riddle with the root system as the theme.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030115,
						735030116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Drusus"
				},
				{
					"id": 735030115,
					"content": "Hehe, let me write something.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030115,
						735030116
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 735030116,
					"content": "Hehe, leave it to me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030117
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 735030117,
					"content": "Hey! Why are you grinning like that!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 735030118,
					"content": "Done. Here, have a look.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030119
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 735030119,
					"content": "\"Where knowledge returns to the sea, treasure lies along the sails.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Drusus"
				},
				{
					"id": 735030120,
					"content": "It reads well! And this riddle also makes people think of \"port\" really easily...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Drusus"
				},
				{
					"id": 735030121,
					"content": "And when it's put with \"where knowledge returns to the sea,\" it's easy to see that the location is related to the Akademiya or Sumeru City...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Drusus"
				},
				{
					"id": 735030122,
					"content": "I never knew you had such a talent.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Drusus"
				},
				{
					"id": 735030123,
					"content": "Wait a minute, I'll paste this riddle in a place where it can be easily discovered...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Drusus"
				},
				{
					"id": 735030124,
					"content": "Huh? Paste it in this area? But the location in the riddle is not that far away. It might be solved right away.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 735030125,
					"content": "Hahaha, I'm giving the riddle solver a range to solve the riddles in.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Drusus"
				},
				{
					"id": 735030126,
					"content": "If I don't do this, then the range will be too big.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Drusus"
				},
				{
					"id": 735030127,
					"content": "Drusus starts putting up the riddle...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030128
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 735030128,
					"content": "Okay, the riddle for this area is done. Let's go to the next place.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Drusus"
				},
				{
					"id": 735030129,
					"content": "Eh? There's another place...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 735030110,
					"content": "The lotus leaf and ships are interesting.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030111
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 735030111,
					"content": "Indeed... It could be fun in another sense if we link the two.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Drusus"
				},
				{
					"id": 735030112,
					"content": "No problem, I'll just make a riddle with this theme.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030115,
						735030116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Drusus"
				},
				{
					"id": 735030113,
					"content": "These are too easy!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 735030114,
					"content": "Too easy? What ideas do you have then?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735030115,
						735030116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Drusus"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7350302,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7350302
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
